$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1,1,4-Triphenyl-1-buten-3-yne5 (7). To a suspension of PdCl2(dppf) (9 mg,
0.025 mmol, 5 mol %) in THF (2.5 mL) in a Schlenk tube was added 2a (82.5
mg, 0.25 mmol) followed by iodobenzene (51 mg, 0.25 mmol) at room
temperature under N2. After aqueous 3 M KOH (0.75 mmol, 0.25 ml) was
added, the reaction mixture turned deep brown immediately. The reaction
mixture was stirred for overnight at room temperature. After the reaction
was complete, the reaction mixture was quenched with sat. NH4Cl solution
and then extracted with ethyl acetate (10 mL x 2). The combined organic
layers were washed with brine and dried over MgSO4. Isolation by silica
gel chromatography. The title compound (79% yield, 55.5 mg). 1H NMR: (300
MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.57-7.52 (m, 2H), 7.45-7.36 (m, 3H), 7.31-7.62 (m, 5H),
7.31-7.27 (m, 5H), 6.24 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 152.8, 141.5,
139.3, 131.5, 130.3, 128.4, 128.4, 128.3, 128.2, 128.1, 127.9, 123.8,
107.2, 93.8, 89.3.
